      ],
      "source": "https://villageoflena.net/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Wisconsin Historical Society recognizes twenty-six historically significant structures in Lena, primarily homes and agricultural buildings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
